# SPROUT (CAV 2025) Table 2 protocols: the file under benchmarks/sprout/examples/sprout/, its Table 2 row name,
# the number of participants |P| and the ground truth Impl. (Y implementable, N not), all four read from
# examples/create_table2.sh and examples/table2_empty.txt of nyu-acsys/sprout at the pinned commit.
# Exception: Impl. of symbolic-two-bidder-no2 (N) and higher-lower-ultimate (Y) is the CAV 2025 paper's Table 2;
# table2_empty.txt has the two entries swapped (checked against the protocols by the paper's definition, 2026-10-22).
# Columns are separated by one TAB.
